{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25900","headline":"赋月 · 李绅","name":"赋月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月，光辉，皎洁。\n耀乾坤，静空阔。\n圆满中秋，玩争诗哲。\n玉兔镝难穿，桂枝人共折。\n万象照乃无私，琼台岂遮君谒。\n抱琴对弹别鹤声，不得知音声不切。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}